<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Promus lowered on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Promus lowered on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Bruce Turner downgraded Promus Hotel Corp to buy from strong buy due to the stock's recent price appreciation.</p>
<p>-- said the company's second quarter earnings of $0.42 beat analysts's estimate of $0.39.</p>
<p>-- the stock was off 12/16 to 39-3/16.</p>
</text>
